          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Facade substructure, integrated, average, Ecolite, at plant
na;
UUID: a4b31a08-3196-3b05-bddb-3e55236c9ebe
Average according to shares of sales: 40% are installed on concrete substrate, 60% are installed on brick substrate.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland. Production occurs at SAPA Building Systems AG in Nenzing (AT) and Bellenberg (DE).
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at SAPA Building Systems AG. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a4b31a08-3196-3b05-bddb-3e55236c9ebe.xml</text>
